id: zoom-locked-pinch
section: Scrolling and gestures
item: T-644: on a page that locks its zoom (user-scalable=no, maximum-scale=1), a pinch zooms it while "Allow zoom on every page" is on (the default)
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-locked.html
kit: cavekit-input-bridging.md R5
wait rect 'sel:h1' 30
calibrate 'sel:h1'
pinch 384 500 150 400
wait zoom 10
wait settled 6
expect zoom-min 1.3
